#: ../../../components/evaluation.md:1
msgid "Evaluator"
msgstr "Evaluator"

#: ../../../components/evaluation.md:3
msgid ""
"`OptimizationStrategy` and `Initializer` delegate converting a batch of "
"design-variable candidates into objective values, raw constraint values, "
"and constraint violation to `Evaluator`, a swappable execution backend. "
"Whether evaluation runs sequentially or in parallel can be switched by "
"swapping out only `Evaluator`, without changing the pipeline-side code."
msgstr "`OptimizationStrategy`や`Initializer`は、設計変数の候補群を目的関数値、生の制約値、制約違反へ変換する処理を、`Evaluator`という差し替え可能な実行バックエンドに委ねています。 評価を逐次実行するか並列実行するかは、パイプライン側のコードを変えずに`Evaluator`だけを差し替えれば切り替えられます。"

#: ../../../components/evaluation.md:6
msgid "Evaluator's role"
msgstr "Evaluatorの役割"

#: ../../../components/evaluation.md:8
msgid ""
"`Evaluator` requires only one method, `evaluate_batch(x, problem) -> "
"EvaluationResult`, to be implemented. `x` receives the set of design "
"variables to evaluate with shape `(n, dim)`, and it builds and returns an"
" `EvaluationResult` using [Problem](problem.md)'s objective and "
"constraint functions."
msgstr "`Evaluator`が実装を要求するメソッドは`evaluate_batch(x, problem) -> EvaluationResult`の1つだけです。 `x`には評価対象の設計変数群が`shape (n, dim)`で渡され、[Problem](problem.md)の目的関数と制約関数を使って`EvaluationResult`を構築して返します。"

#: ../../../components/evaluation.md:11
msgid "`EvaluationResult` is a dataclass holding three arrays."
msgstr "`EvaluationResult`は3つの配列を持つデータクラスです。"

#: ../../../components/evaluation.md:13
msgid "**`f`**: Objective values. Shape `(n, n_obj)`"
msgstr "**`f`**：目的関数値。`shape (n, n_obj)`"

#: ../../../components/evaluation.md:14
msgid ""
"**`g`**: Raw constraint values. Shape `(n, n_constraints)`. `(n, 0)` if "
"the problem has no constraints"
msgstr "**`g`**：生の制約値。`shape (n, n_constraints)`。問題が制約を持たない場合は`(n, 0)`"

#: ../../../components/evaluation.md:15
msgid ""
"**`cv`**: Aggregated constraint violation per candidate. Shape `(n,)`. "
"All `0` if the problem has no constraints"
msgstr "**`cv`**：候補ごとの集約された制約違反量。`shape (n,)`。問題が制約を持たない場合は全て`0`"

